h=A.aH(["prosperity","CEREMONIAL CLOSING: Look at the bowl of water and acknowledge the resources supporting your life. Say: May gratitude accompany what I receive, fairness guide what I exchange, and wisdom guide what I preserve. Record your next financial action. Pour away the water respectfully and put the bowl away.","love","CEREMONIAL CLOSING: Look at your flowers, objects, or written qualities. Say: May my relationships be rooted in dignity, freely chosen affection, honesty, and mutual care. Record one act of kindness that respects your boundaries. Put your materials away.","protection","CEREMONIAL CLOSING: Place your clean cloth beside the water. Say: May clear judgment guide my steps, healthy boundaries protect my peace, and responsible action strengthen my safety. Record one practical protective measure. Put away your materials and leave the space clean.","lunar","CEREMONIAL CLOSING: Reflect on the Moon or the life transition you recorded. Say: I honor the changes behind me, the responsibilities before me, and the possibilities still unfolding. Write one next step and close your journal.","dreams","CEREMONIAL CLOSING: Read your dream notes without judgment. Say: I welcome insight with curiosity, examine meaning with care, and remain grounded in what I can know. Underline one useful reflection and close your notebook.","ancestors","CEREMONIAL CLOSING: Look at your keepsake or remembered name. Say: I carry forward what was wise, learn from what was difficult, and honor memory through compassionate action. Record one lesson to preserve and return your keepsake to its place if used."],k,k)
g=A.aH(["prosperity","WEEKLY OBSERVANCE: Review seven days of spending, saving, giving, and obligations. Record one decision that supported stability and one that needs improvement. Choose a realistic financial action for the coming week.","love","WEEKLY OBSERVANCE: Reflect on how you offered and received care this week. Record one moment of healthy communication and one boundary worth strengthening. Choose a respectful act of appreciation.","protection","WEEKLY OBSERVANCE: Review your personal safety, privacy, and boundaries. Identify one precaution that worked and one vulnerability you can address. Write a practical safety action for the next seven days.","lunar","WEEKLY OBSERVANCE: Review how your intention developed during the past seven days. Note what changed, what remains unfinished, and one adjustment that better aligns your actions with your goals.","dreams","WEEKLY OBSERVANCE: Review your dream journal or reflection notes from the past week. Identify recurring emotions or themes without treating them as predictions. Write one question for further reflection.","ancestors","WEEKLY OBSERVANCE: Recall a family story, teaching, or memory. Write down one detail worth preserving and one constructive way to honor that lesson during the coming week."],k,k)
